.0,"resolved_by":"catalogue","heritage":true},{"id":"hl-stadhuis","name":"Stadhuis","kind":"Museum","lat":52.89478,"lon":5.64564,"dist_km":6.9,"rank_score":4.0,"resolved_by":"catalogue","heritage":true}],"do":[{"name":"Woudagemaal","type":"activity","detail":"The largest steam driven pumping station still working anywhere in the world, opened in 1920 and still started when Friesland needs the water off. World Heritage listed, with a visitor centre and a guided tour in the ticket.","evidence":{"n_sources":8,"of":11,"urls":["https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attractions-g1045111-Activities-Lemmer_Friesland_Province.html","https://www.friesland.nl/en/routes/1173308402/iconic-water-features-sailing-route","https://www.visitingthedutchcountryside.com/friesland/things-to-do-lemmer-friesland-netherlands/"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Sail the IJsselmeer","type":"activity","detail":"Lemmer sits on the gate between the Frisian lakes and the old Zuiderzee, so the round of the IJsselmeer starts here. The open crossing wants a decent yacht, not a sloop.","season":[4,5,6,7,8,9,10],"evidence":{"n_sources":7,"of":11,"urls":["https://www.friesland.nl/en/plan/see-do/to-do/routes/all-routes/3564397914/round-ijsselmeer-sailing-route","https://www.naupar.com/blog/route-suggestion-ijsselmeer-frisian-coast/","https://www.leboat.com/boating-vacations/netherlands/holland/friesland-travel-guide"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Lemsterstrand","type":"swim","detail":"Three and a half hectares of sand on the lake side just south west of town, looking into the bay. No sailing or surfing off the beach itself in summer.","season":[6,7,8,9],"evidence":{"n_sources":5,"of":11,"urls":["https://www.livetheworld.com/activities/netherlands/lemmer-beach","https://www.waterlandvanfriesland.nl/en/lemmer","https://www.visitingthedutchcountryside.com/friesland/things-to-do-lemmer-friesland-netherlands/"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Walk around the Dock","type":"activity